     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>FYI for dataheads, cool opportunity to do good things for the world with data - see below.</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Rob Reich</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">re...@stanford.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Thu, Jul 9, 2015 at 3:39 PM<br>Subject: [Interesting Jobs] Project Lead, Data Science for Social Sector, at Bayes Impact, SF<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">interes...@lists.stanford.edu</a><br>Cc: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">er...@bayesimpact.org</a><br><br><br><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Questions about this position can be directed to Eric Liu, one of the founders of the organization.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Rob</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*BAYES IMPACT – TURN DATA INTO ACTION*</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Bayes Impact is a technology nonprofit that uses data science to solve</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">pressing social challenges across the globe. We build intuitive and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">powerful software applications that empower governments, nonprofits, and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">individuals to make critical, data-driven decisions. We turn data into</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">actions that impact the lives of billions of people.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">We are a small team &lt;</span><a href=\"http://www.bayesimpact.org/about\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.bayesimpact.org/about&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468023508000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1p7IFLTWttDbqmwHsqC3ck\">http://www.bayesimpact.org/about</a><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">&gt; of open-minded,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">driven, egalitarian, usually sarcastic people who think there’s more to</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">life than ad targeting algorithms and whatever messaging app kids will use</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">next week. We are looking for talented, big-hearted individuals who are</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">hungry for hard problems that uplift people in need.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Our backers include Y Combinator, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation, Robert</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Wood Johnson Foundation, Tableau Foundation, Linkedin For Good, and others.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*PROJECT DEVELOPMENT LEAD*</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">We are looking for an explorer and visionary to join our team and develop</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">our next big projects. Can algorithms be used to save lives by reducing</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">wait times for ambulance dispatch? Will better data systems improve</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">transparency in the criminal justice system? Is data science the key to</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">realizing the future of personalized health? You will identify big</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">questions like these and answer them with game-changing technology</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">solutions.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Our mission is not just to create reports and recommendations; we build</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">production-level software applications and deploy them in the field.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">However, turning an idea into a full-fledged operational solution that</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">could improve the lives of millions is no small feat. If you thrive in</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">ambiguity and hustle by nature, this role is for you.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*THE ROLE *</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">We are looking for someone who can become an overnight expert in social</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">issues, build partnerships, engage researchers, convince funders, negotiate</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">roadblocks, sizing up incumbents, identify relevant technologies, devise</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">software solutions, and do whatever it takes to make things happen. You can</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">expect to:</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Research social issues and identify project opportunities where</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">software and data science can create transformative impact</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Develop the entire execution plan for a project; from research to</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">prototyping to deployment and measurement in the field</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Collaborate with our technical team to develop project concepts and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">technical specifications</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Build partnerships with governments, nonprofits, and other</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">organizations to develop and implement solutions</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Secure funding for projects – this includes writing and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">negotiating grants and contracts with foundations, governments, and other</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">funders</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Lead the transition from project acquisition to technical product</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">development by working with our technical project managers</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Devise our strategy for new project initiatives, focus areas, and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">technologies</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">As a project development lead, you play a critical role in our</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">organization: Define the future of Bayes Impact’s work and create solutions</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">to the biggest social challenges we face today.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*FOR EXAMPLE*</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">A hospital is severely over capacity in their emergency department. This is</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">causing delays in the delivery of critical care to patients and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">contributing to skyrocketing healthcare costs. Could data science be used</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">to identify the highest emergency department utilizers and help deploy</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">preventative care? What preventative care programs does the hospital run</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">and how can we use technology to better deploy them? What solution would we</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">build? Would physicians be the main users of our solution, and if so, how</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">would we garner adoption among them? Are there existing players and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">vendors? Is our solution a significant improvement to the status quo? How</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">much impact will this have, and in what time frame? Is this a unique or</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">systemic problem; can we scale our solution to other hospitals? Are data</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">from the hospital’s IT systems easily accessible? Would we have to collect</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">new data? Who will fund this project; the hospital, a foundation, or</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">corporation? You will answer questions like these, and many others, in your</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">quest to identify and scope projects, and then own their successful</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">execution.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*YOU HAVE:*</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- A deep passion for making the world a better place</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Technical aptitude and a strong understanding of data science and</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">software development. Technical experience is a plus</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Excellent writing skills. Experience writing grants and contracts is a</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">plus</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Strong communication and relationship management skills. You will be</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">representing Bayes in partnership, funding, and client conversations</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">- Exceptional research skills and an investigative mindset. You will</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">become the go-to expert in your focus areas</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">*APPLY*</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">This is a full time position located in San Francisco, CA.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">If you’re interested, please send us your resume and a bit about what you</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">want in your work (/life/love/next meal/etc). Email us at</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a href style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">car...@bayesimpact.org</a><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">. We’ll listen and get back to you.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> </span><br style=\"color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><br>_______________________________________________<br>\r\ninterestingjobs mailing list<br>\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">interes...@lists.stanford.edu</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://mailman.stanford.edu/mailman/listinfo/interestingjobs\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mailman.stanford.edu/mailman/listinfo/interestingjobs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468023509000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YIDwhqsG7vr7BHX427G6w\">https://mailman.stanford.edu/mailman/listinfo/interestingjobs</a><br>\r\n<br></div><br></div></div>\r\n</div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Myfanwy Johnston</div><div>Ph.D Candidate, Animal Behavior<br>University of California at Davis<div>Biotelemetry Lab<br></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
